    "text": "If set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> and set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, then",
